  "description": "The Energie Carbon is our high performance full carbon cyclocross race bike\n\nDesigned specifically to meet the demands of all-out CX assaults and help you achieve your best come race day. Our full carbon High-Modulus T700 frame features increased stiffness and mud clearance making this a competitive CX race bike.\n\nThe Energie CRX eTap comes equipped with a race ready single ring set up built around the all new SRAM Force eTap AXS groupset. It combines a revolutionary new gear ratio with precise electronic shifting to ensure you are always in the right gear when you need it most. The Force AXS groupset combines a race ratio cassette(10-33t) with a 38t single chainring and Force HRD disc brakes. This race machine is completed with tubeless-ready 38mm Prime BlackEdition Carbon Disc wheelset paired with Vee XCX TLR tyres and Zipp Servie Course finishing kit.\n\nThe Energie CRX eTap frameset features a High-Modulus T700 HM-UD Carbon construction for superior strength to weight. Full internal cable routing has been specifically designed to prevent ingress of mud and water and to increase comfort when shouldering the bike during racing",
